h4. Your account

Your user page shows your uploads, favourites, favourite groups, saved searches and level. Others can see your public activity; they cannot see your blacklist, your settings, or private favourite groups.

h4. Feedback

Staff can leave feedback on an account -- positive, neutral or negative -- as a record of how the account has behaved. Feedback is visible on the user page. See [[help:community]] for what the site expects.

h4. Deactivating

You can deactivate your own account from your settings. This removes your favourites, saved searches and favourite groups. Posts you uploaded stay, because other people's tags and pools depend on them.
